{"item_id": "36e01ccedbaff5e8", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "两个月了，我的“自研”游戏引擎进展", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qrtY6hEmz", "project_url": null, "author": "那只敏捷的棕毛狐狸", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/33265147", "published_at": "2026-09-01T05:15:01+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-09-30T18:53:00+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "## 📝 完整更新记录（自 2026-07-12 上次视频）\n\n### 🎨 渲染管线\n- 全面迁移至 **WebGPU (Dawn)**，删除 bgfx，唯一渲染路径\n- **Clustered Forward+ 集群渲染**：光源按视锥集群剔除\n- **PBR + IBL**：BRDF LUT 预积分、间接光 GGX 预滤波\n- **CSM 级联阴影（6 级）** + PCF 软阴影，级联边界固定正交范围防抖动\n- **SSAO**（Crytek 深度重建，半分辨率 + 深度感知模糊）\n- Bloom", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 9582, "danmaku": 3, "favorites": 114}, "tags": ["游戏引擎", "unreal", "godot", "游戏开发", "AI", "人工智能", "虚幻引擎", "游戏", "unity", "经验分享"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1qrtY6hEmz", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qrtY6hEmz", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "new", "run_id": "20260930T182758"}
{"item_id": "950814e43c55d95b", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "为什么很多程序员都不去做独立开发者？", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13S421A7KF", "project_url": null, "author": "程序员古德", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/1968633158", "published_at": "2024-02-24T23:29:50+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-09-30T18:53:00+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "对于那些想要突破传统工作模式，寻求创新和收入突破的程序员来说，独立开发者是一个非常值得尝试的选择，它或许可以真的使程序员实现工作自由、时间自由、消费自由。", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 12898, "danmaku": 6, "favorites": 46}, "tags": ["程序员副业", "极客", "人工智能", "技术", "互联网", "独立开发", "代码", "程序员"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV13S421A7KF", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13S421A7KF", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20260930T182758"}
{"item_id": "92d5c8b5d06bc86b", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "数字游民必看 | 独立开发者的出海赚钱实战经验分享!", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1d9dKYxEiX", "project_url": null, "author": "OpenBuild开源社区", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/483336099", "published_at": "2025-04-09T23:45:52+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-09-30T18:53:00+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "主持人: 秋秋 @0xqiuqiuu\n嘉宾: Levi Yuan@leviyuen\n\n本期我们 OpenBuild 有幸采访到资深独立开发者 Levi Yuan，分享他如何从传统职场转型为独立开发者，并成功实现出海接单赚取美金的宝贵经验。\n\n嘉宾介绍: \nLevi 个人分享，35被裁员，自学编程，独立开发🧑‍💻\n\n分享内容\n1.为什么选择独立开发 \n2.通过软件赚美金为什么是一个不错的商业模式 \n3.我是如何从0到1学习编程的 \n4.我从独立开发到成为数字游民的经历分享", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 39944, "danmaku": 7, "favorites": 3038}, "tags": ["互联网", "Web3", "经验分享", "项目", "数字游民", "独立开发者"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发者 出海", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1d9dKYxEiX", "query": "独立开发者 出海", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1d9dKYxEiX", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20260930T182758"}
{"item_id": "9da893e06d4b9e78", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "失踪人口回归！我的第一个出海产品，是怎样冷启动赚到第一个 100 美元的？", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kBQeYiEpv", "project_url": "https://tailwindresume.co/", "author": "独立开发者Viking", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/480241067", "published_at": "2025-03-17T09:13:22+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-09-30T18:53:00+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "失踪人口回归！去年九月份我当爸爸了，我们夫妻两人独立带娃，时间少了很多，所以更新频率降低了很多，在今年 2 月份还是完成了人生一个里程碑的事件，我的第一个出海产品，简单简历的英文版：TailwindResume https://tailwindresume.co/ 正式上线了。直接说结论，我通过冷启动的方式在两周内收获 50 个用户，赚到了 100 美元，不是特别惊人，所以非常真实，是每个想出海的独立开发者都可以完全复制的经验，下面是整个过程的记录。\n\n文字版：https://vikingz.me/fir", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 10714, "danmaku": 2, "favorites": 703}, "tags": ["AI IN ALL！", "出海", "全栈开发", "一人公司", "编程", "自由职业", "独立开发", "前端开发"], "links": ["https://tailwindresume.co/", "https://vikingz.me/fir"], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发者 出海", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1kBQeYiEpv", "query": "独立开发者 出海", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kBQeYiEpv", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20260930T182758"}
